WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.815
Andromeda, the other giant.

00:02.533 --> 00:05.383
Andromeda is two and a half million light-years away.

00:05.898 --> 00:11.278
With our Milky Way she is one of the group's two largest galaxies, and she is moving towards us.

00:11.826 --> 00:16.236
From our side this is a photograph; as we turn, a model takes over.

00:16.790 --> 00:21.098
Her tilt and rings are measured; the exact shape of her arms is ours.
